trait-name-HealingTraining = Healing Training
trait-description-HealingTraining =
    You received additional training in battlefield medicine, allowing you to apply healing items and syringes faster.
    This trait boosts your healing speed to 1.5x, intended for non-medical characters.

trait-name-ExperiencedHealer = Experienced Healer
trait-description-ExperiencedHealer =
    Medicine is your calling. No one can match your speed when it comes to treating wounds and administering injections.
    This trait boosts your healing speed to 2x, matching the innate boost of a trained medical doctor.
